        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Paint contains 2D fill, stroke, strokeWidth, opacity, cap/joint values, clip-space coordinates and z ordering. It is part of the entity State typed-array block. The current property spelling is strokeWidth. Paint.setClip takes two Vec2 values for spatial clipping; it is not the path-length reveal API."
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "typescript",
          "code": "const path = new Path(\"M -2 0 L 2 0\", { fill: Color.NONE });\npath.setStroke(0.12, hex(\"#38BDF8\"));\npath.setCap(CapType.ROUND);\npath.setJoint(JointType.ROUND);\npath.setOpacity(0.9);"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Paint](/api-core-paint#paint), [CapType](/api-utils#gpu-utils), [JointType](/api-utils#gpu-utils), [State](/api-core#state)."
        }
      ]
    },
