    {
      "id": "update-effects-deliberately",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Update effects deliberately"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Changing an effect’s topology or shader code can rebuild pipelines. Keep per-frame animation in parameters/state when possible. Inspect the exact effect constructor or builder method: option names and scale conventions differ by effect. A strong glow can extend beyond geometric bounds, so leave visual padding even when the base shape is correctly framed."
        }
      ]
